{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "嘉維爾之拳",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "738c6ede10ded7d1995853f50567ccca997098b5243634b017de66d29334d409",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "這裡的樓房跟其他部族明顯不一樣了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "破房子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "唔，這裡的建築和裝飾好粗糙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "不過奇怪的器械殘骸到處都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，你的部族建設得挺特別啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "看來他們也和你一樣喜歡搗鼓機器了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "這都是我的族人們的傑作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯。他們也都體會到了機械的魅力，憑藉著自己的熱情將這個部族建設到了現在這個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快看，是嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大酋長說的是真的，她要用大醜和嘉維爾再進行一次對決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？！這怎麼能錯過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "哇，好多人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "這些人裡有不少是在祭典後聚集到這裡來的其他部族的人，他們也將會加入我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哦，所以你要說些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嘉維爾，原本如果你就那麼離開的話，我不會管你。但是你既然你又站在我的面前，那麼我就要在這裡打倒你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "因為你太強了，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你還記得那一天嗎，嘉維爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "那一天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "在那天之前，我和你一樣，堅信自己的拳頭就是一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "哇啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘉維爾勝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哈哈，我又贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "哼，再來，下次我一定會贏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "好呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "咦，大地怎麼在震動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "看，是那邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "那......那是什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "好大的鐵塊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是薩爾貢的移動城市......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "薩爾貢是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "薩爾貢是我們的國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "移動城市又是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "移動城市就是很大的部族，在上面住著許多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也是年輕時有一次上去看到過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了，別害怕，它不會開過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是和我們一輩子都沒關係的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，你怎麼了，身體不舒服嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "沒什麼，我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哦，我記得啊，薩爾貢的移動城市正好開過了我們這裡附近嘛，從那天之後你就變得怪怪的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我反而覺得不可思議，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "看到那樣的東西，難道不會覺得驚訝嗎？不會覺得震撼嗎？不會覺得自己渺小嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "你問我那天的感受，那確實是覺得“哇，好大啊”，可是那和我有什麼關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你總是這樣，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "在那天之後，我就對和你打架失去了興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我拜託依娜姆幫我尋找和機械有關的書籍，開始學習薩爾貢語和機械知識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "然後我遇到了大祭司，我們兩個人開始一起製造大醜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "這我知道啊，我不是還去找過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嗯？這麼說來，那邊那隻怪傢伙就是你的隱形朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "哇，什麼時候到我身邊來的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "總覺得跟大帝老闆一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "大帝？你是說那隻企鵝嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是的，咦，你認識老闆嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "認識認識，當然認識，雖然我們大概有幾十年沒見面了，咦，是幾十年嗎？還是幾百年？算了，反正你身上確實有那傢伙的氣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "幾百年是怎麼回事啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "誒誒誒，沒想到老闆在這裡還有朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "原來你真的存在啊，我一直以為是祖瑪瑪腦子出問題了出現了幻覺，在羅德島的時候我還專門研究過類似的病症咧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "噢，你不知道，嘉維爾，小時候你來找祖瑪瑪的時候，我一直在旁邊看著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "就像這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "消失了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "哈哈哈，我平時是不會出現在你們的面前的，但是現在要駕駛大醜，所以就沒辦法啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "不過跟小傢伙們一起造機器還是挺有趣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "說到大醜，你不去駕駛真的沒關係嗎？我看要撞到房子了誒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
      "text": "啊？啊，我忘了！那等會兒聊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗚哇，真的一下子又回到駕駛席了，好厲害啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "果然和老闆一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哦，差點忘了你還在說話。不過老實說，祖瑪瑪，反正最後都要打一架，你說這些真的有必要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "這些話是說給你聽的，也是說給我自己聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你知道嗎，嘉維爾，對我來說，你是最大的阻礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "啊？是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "確切地說，不是你，而是你這樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我曾經試圖想要說服許多人去瞭解機器的魅力，但是最終，他們中有絕大多數都不感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "因為有你這樣厲害的人在給他們做榜樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你這樣的存在告訴他們，在這裡，能打就能夠獲得想要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你的強大，堵死了前進的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "所以我下定決心，我要打破人們的這種想法，我要用更強的力量，摧毀你建立起的這種對自身力量的盲目崇拜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "誒，博士，我覺得她說的蠻有道理的啊，你覺得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "確實。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，你到底是幫哪邊的啊！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可頌",
              "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
              "text": "雖然確實有道理，但是又好像有哪裡不對......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "機器不錯。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "對啊，那個大傢伙酷誒！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "不過老實說，我也快要被你說服了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "但是我也沒想做大家的榜樣啊，我只代表我自己，我覺得拳頭可以解決一切，關別人什麼事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我知道，這不怪你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "但是，我依然決心打敗你，嘉維爾，用這大醜的力量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "所有人聽好了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "接下來，大醜將和嘉維爾重新進行一次決鬥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "這場戰鬥將決定誰才是真正的大酋長！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "大祭司，要戰鬥了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "噢，沒問題！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉維爾，準備好了嗎！讓你的同伴一起上也沒關係！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我都已經等不及了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你們別來插手，這一戰，我要親手打倒這個大傢伙！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "來吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "先試試正常功率！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "我射！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘿，別以為能炸到我第二次！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "噢，不愧是嘉維爾，出色的反應神經！但是沒關係，嘗嘗我的巨大鐵拳！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "拼力氣？我喜歡！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "嘉維爾，好厲害！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可頌",
          "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
          "text": "嘉維爾太厲害了！居然一個人扛住了這個大傢伙的鐵拳！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "雖然我體檢時就有過這樣的疑問了，她為什麼會是醫療幹員啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "......雖然是敵人，但我都要忍不住為你喝彩了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "但是但是，這還沒有完呢！為了應付這種情況，大醜可是有功率全開的模式的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "我按！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "什麼？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "那個大傢伙的力氣好像變得更大了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "嘉維爾的力量被比下去了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "啊，多麼動聽的聲音！......嗯？等等，面板好像有點不對......嗯嗯嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "大祭司，情況怎麼樣了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "哇哦，我感覺我的屁股要被烤焦了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我是問你大醜的情況！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "哦，我只是順便說一下我的狀況！我覺得是引擎功率太大，大醜開始暴走了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "感覺還挺刺激的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "你先出來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "不是要戰鬥嗎？就這麼戰鬥吧！來吧，嘉維爾，讓我就這麼解決——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "大祭司！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "哦，好吧，真遺憾，看來我需要改變策略。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_074",
          "text": "祖瑪瑪，不用擔心我，我來盡可能穩住它，在這個期間讓大醜停下來吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......嘉維爾，你們先走吧，這與你們無關。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "說什麼呢，你不是要打敗我嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我會打敗你，但不是用這種方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哎呀，別這麼見外，我當然要幫忙了，對吧，博士？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "打大怪獸！我來幫忙！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "宴，可頌，做好準備戰鬥！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "宴",
              "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
              "text": "誒，要我對付這個大傢伙嗎？不是吧，好麻煩耶。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可頌",
              "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
              "text": "博士，結束後我要收加班費哦！三倍哦！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
