              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士我有時候覺得你的性格還挺討人厭的！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "快點準備指揮了！"
            }
          ]
        }
